    "UsingEmbeddedSIMDownloadServiceHint" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When no network connection is available, the system may use the embedded eSIM data channel to download an eSIM profile.\n\nThis typically occurs when:\n1. Wi-Fi is disconnected\n2. No SIM card is inserted and no eSIM is installed\n3. An eSIM is being added or downloaded"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当设备没有可用的网络连接时，系统可能会使用内置eSIM的数据通道来下载eSIM配置文件\n\n该状态通常出现在: \n1. 未连接 Wi-Fi\n2. 未插入 SIM 卡且没有已安装的eSIM\n3. 正在添加或下载eSIM"
          }
        }
      }
